00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:42.890
Oh, yeah. I've been here...

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.690
I knew it.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:52.520
What is it?

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.570
It's called a time capsule.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:59.030
You put your treasured belongings in there, then dig it up a few years later.

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.660
But why do such a thing?

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.580
Why? Well...

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:07.160
because it's nostalgic, I guess.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.920
Nostalgic... Is that it?

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:16.840
These bring back memories! I loved all of these!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:20.170
Look: this weird thing was a souvenir from my dad.

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:21.970
So you loved it, yes?

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:25.850
Uh, I think I put it in here because I didn't want it around...

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.730
There are several acorns in here too.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:31.940
That doll...

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:34.230
Come to think of it, where is Guriko-san?

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:36.690
Oh. I'd totally forgotten.

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:44.320
Maybe we should bury this again, in the same spot.

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:48.080
Add some of the acorns you collected today too.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:52.460
That way, next time we dig it up,
it will bring memories for you too, right?

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:57.550
Ao... that makes me happy.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:59.340
I look forward to that day.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:06.430
I feel like I've understood what it means to be "nostalgic," if only a little.

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:11.710
When it's autumn again, next year and the year after,
I'm sure I'll remember this day.

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:17.150
Then, when a few years have passed,
I think I'll say "This takes me back!" just like you.

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:20.070
Yeah. I look forward to it too!

